---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy | Edubuzz"
  description="How Edubuzz uses cookies and similar technologies, including cookies set by Google AdSense and analytics providers."
  canonicalUrl={Astro.url.href}
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">This Cookie Policy explains how Edubuzz ("we", "us", "our") uses cookies and similar technologies on edubuzz.co.za. It should be read together with our <a href="/privacy" class="text-green-800 hover:text-green-900 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">What are cookies?</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Cookies are small text files placed on your device when you visit a website. They help the site remember your actions and preferences and allow us and our partners to understand how the site is used.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Types of cookies we use</h2>
    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 mb-4">
      <li><strong>Essential cookies</strong> — required for core functionality such as sign-in sessions and security (CSRF protection). The site cannot work correctly without these.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics cookies</strong> — help us understand how visitors use the site so we can improve it. These may be set by Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity.</li>
      <li><strong>Advertising cookies</strong> — used to show relevant ads and measure their performance. These may be set by Google AdSense and other advertising partners.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Advertising and Google AdSense</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">We use Google AdSense to display advertising. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites.</p>
    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 mb-4">
      <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to our site and/or other sites on the internet.</li>
      <li>You may opt out of personalised advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-green-800 hover:text-green-900 hover:underline">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
      <li>You can also opt out of third-party vendor cookies for personalised advertising at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-green-800 hover:text-green-900 hover:underline">www.aboutads.info</a>.</li>
      <li>For more information on how Google uses data, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-green-800 hover:text-green-900 hover:underline">How Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Managing cookies</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Most web browsers let you control cookies through their settings. You can block or delete cookies at any time, but please note that some parts of the site may not function properly if you do.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">For any questions about our use of cookies, contact us at <a href="/contact" class="text-green-800 hover:text-green-900 hover:underline">edubuzz.co.za/contact</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
